      "name": "Ghee or Oil",
      "amount": "2 tbsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp of ghee or oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the lamb mince and cook until browned.",
    "Add the turmeric powder, red chili powder, and garam masala powder. Mix well.",
    "Add salt to taste and mix well.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let the mixture simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 180°C.",
    "Stuff each individual mini-cocotte with the lamb mixture.",
    "Top each cocotte with a small piece of cheese and cover with a lid.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
  ],
